---
/**
 * Badge for a standard or a certification body. Teal on pale teal, 9.84.
 * Squared off (8px) rather than a pill: a chip is an inventory item, a badge
 * is a credential, and the two should not look interchangeable.
 */
---

<span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-control bg-teal-50 px-2.5 py-1 font-display text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold text-teal-800">
  <slot />
</span>
